cs623accel PCI accelerator driver (see ../README.md for the design and current status).

Layout:
  accel-main.c   PCI probe/remove, BAR mapping, IRQ handlers, module init
  accel-api.c    character device (/dev/cs623accel): open/read/write; a written struct msg is dispatched to the ops table
  accel-ops.c    device operations: query, set mode, alloc, free, copy (DMA), compute, reset
  acceldev.h     register map and driver structures
  interface.h    kernel/user message format (struct msg)
  user/          user library (accellib.c) and test (usertest.c)

Build: make    (builds the module and the user code; needs kernel headers)
Note: accel-ops.c still has unfinished do_free / do_reset / do_compute.
